-------------------------------------------------
python src/os/test_value_domain.py  ->  SUITE FAIL 6/9  (AC-VDB6/7/8 red)
   AC-VDB6 red: the benefit face's landed tier rows live under facts.tiers and
                had no reader in the suite yet.
   AC-VDB7 red: the benefit face imported the module but called none of its
                comparators - import without a call is dead wiring.
   AC-VDB8 red: no battery row existed, exactly as the criterion requires.
After registering ("os-value-domain", test_value_domain.py, 9) and regenerating
